.inc CoilcraftTemplates.lib

*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 0805HQ-2N5
* Inductance = 2.5nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-19.8GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor RF Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 0805HQ-2N5 port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.029pF Ind=2.7nH
X1 port1 port2 Model2A PARAMS:
+ R1=6
+ R2=0.02
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.0000069
+ K3= {Ind}
.ends 0805HQ-2N5

